            <ArticleTitle>Theological reflections on the ethics of pain control among the terminally ill.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>13-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Explores the reality of pain thru explications of the theological notions of &quot;justification by pain,&quot; &quot;justification by death,&quot; and &quot;justification by faith.&quot; Notes particularly the facilitating role of the hospital chaplain in the understanding of pain and its possible Christian meanings.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
